  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-plugin-recommend",
      "text": "**Plugin recommender for DeepSeek Harness** — search and rank DSH plugins from a marketplace catalog by need description, category and tags, with match reasons."
    },
    {
      "section": "Compatibility",
      "text": "Tool schemas are validated against the `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools` value-schema DSL at plugin load (checked against dsh-tools 0.1.0-rc.6 and 0.1.1-rc.2). Earlier releases used JSON-Schema `required` at the root of `output.schema` and closed nested objects without declared properties, which made the host abort the whole profile boot with `unsupported JSON schema: schema.required is not supported by the value schema DSL` and could reject the tool's own results. Current releases fix both; if an affected version left your DSH unable to start, remove the plugin from the profile (or upgrade) — no data is lost."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Embedded catalog: **1135 entries** generated from the awesome-dsh-plugin data (name, repo, category, description, auto-derived tags).\n- Free-text scoring: name matches weigh most, then tags, then description; category filter narrows results.\n- Live refresh: pulls the latest catalog from the awesome-dsh-plugin README over HTTPS (fallback: embedded catalog)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Tools",
      "text": "| Tool | Action | What it does |\n|---|---|---|\n| `recommend` | `search` | Top-N plugins for a need description (`query`), optional `category` / `topN`; each result includes score + match reasons |\n| | `categories` | List catalog categories with counts |\n| | `detail` | Full catalog entry for one plugin name |\n| | `similar` | Nearest alternatives to a plugin (shared tags / category / description overlap) |\n| | `refresh` | Fetch the latest catalog from the awesome-dsh-plugin README |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "```\nrecommend search \"browser automation with screenshots\"\nrecommend search \"网页浏览\" category tools\nrecommend detail dsh-plugin-gate\nrecommend categories\n\nSearch results include a `details` breakdown (name +3 / tags +2 / description +1 / category +2), are deduplicated by repository url, and support `diversify` + `perCategory` so one category cannot fill the list.\n\nAlways cross-check a recommendation with the installation safety gate (`gate_scan` from dsh-plugin-gate) before installing."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```bash\nnode --check lib/*.js\nnode test/recommend.test.mjs\nnode scripts/gen-catalog.mjs   # rebuild lib/catalog.json from awesome data\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "Roadmap",
      "text": "See [ROADMAP.md](./ROADMAP.md) — next five versions (v1.1.0 – v1.5.0): similar & dedupe, popularity ranking, incremental refresh, requirement clarification, environment presets."
    }
  ],
